<title>USA: Specialized Health gets FDA phlebotomy okay.</title>
<headline>Specialized Health gets FDA phlebotomy okay.</headline>
<dateline>BOUNTIFUL, Utah 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Specialized Health Products International Inc said Monday that it has received U.S. Food and Drug Administration clearance of its 510(k) Premarket Notification, for its ExtreSafe Phlebotomy Device.</p>
<p>The ExtreSafe Phlebotomy Device is designed for use with blood collection.</p>
<p>The company said it is negotiating alliances to sell and distribute the new device on a worldwide basis.</p>
</text>
